(5444950, 783882, 103032, '<td valign="top">This is a creepy pic.  That''s a gnarly hand.  B&amp;W fits nicely. Nice creepy shot for the challenge.</td>', 'This is a creepy pic.  That''s a gnarly hand.  B&W fits nicely. Nice creepy shot for the challenge.', '2009-04-20 07:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444960, 783863, 103032, '<td valign="top">Clowns creep me out...  Nice details on the face, bloodshot eyes, messed up teeth work well...  The shallow DOF works well for the shot.  The lighting on his face works well to focus on him.  I can''t tell what the red in the background is but make me think of "evil" for some reason.  I think this is a well done image for the challenge.</td>', 'Clowns creep me out...  Nice details on the face, bloodshot eyes, messed up teeth work well...  The shallow DOF works well for the shot.  The lighting on his face works well to focus on him.  I can''t tell what the red in the background is but make me think of "evil" for some reason.  I think this is a well done image for the challenge.', '2009-04-20 08:04:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444967, 783612, 103032, '<td valign="top">Good image depicting a nightmare.  Good that you kept the bad guy in the shadows and that part of the composition darker; while the victim is in the light and in color.  The concept works well to depict a nightmare.  But here''s a thought, since the bad guy is in focus, does that mean the person having the nightmare is afraid of being the bad guy???  That''s my read.  If the victim was in focus and the bad guy out of focus, I would interpret that as the victim having the nightmare...  Just a thought...    Either way, well done image.</td>', 'Good image depicting a nightmare.  Good that you kept the bad guy in the shadows and that part of the composition darker; while the victim is in the light and in color.  The concept works well to depict a nightmare.  But here''s a thought, since the bad guy is in focus, does that mean the person having the nightmare is afraid of being the bad guy???  That''s my read.  If the victim was in focus and the bad guy out of focus, I would interpret that as the victim having the nightmare...  Just a thought...    Either way, well done image.', '2009-04-20 08:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444968, 783411, 103032, '<td valign="top">Nice legs...  The legs draw you in, the shadow... well, that''s why guys have issues :)     Nice nightmare image.</td>', 'Nice legs...  The legs draw you in, the shadow... well, that''s why guys have issues :)     Nice nightmare image.', '2009-04-20 08:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444974, 783540, 103032, '<td valign="top">Don''t know how much the pictured lens cost, but I''ve had this nightmare....  and unfortunately this reality :(  I can relate.  Good image for the challenge...</td>', 'Don''t know how much the pictured lens cost, but I''ve had this nightmare....  and unfortunately this reality :(  I can relate.  Good image for the challenge...', '2009-04-20 08:32:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445007, 783135, 15711, '<td valign="top">YIKES!!  That is creepy as hell. Well done.</td>', 'YIKES!!  That is creepy as hell. Well done.', '2009-04-20 09:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445008, 783863, 15711, '<td valign="top">God I hate clowns.  This just brings that feeling home.  Those teeth!!  Man, this IS a NIGHTMARE.  Well done.</td>', 'God I hate clowns.  This just brings that feeling home.  Those teeth!!  Man, this IS a NIGHTMARE.  Well done.', '2009-04-20 09:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
