(5445012, 783850, 15711, '<td valign="top">That truly is my fear.  I think I drowned in a former life. I wake up in the night choking.  It''s weird.  I can''t even look at his eyes - it scares the heck out of me.  YIKES.  Well done. 8</td>', 'That truly is my fear.  I think I drowned in a former life. I wake up in the night choking.  It''s weird.  I can''t even look at his eyes - it scares the heck out of me.  YIKES.  Well done. 8', '2009-04-20 09:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445015, 783956, 15711, '<td valign="top">I had a similar idea with an empty crib but didn''t have one.  This is really good. I like how Raggedy Ann is slightly more saturated with the sepia/yellow tones.  Good perspective and story.</td>', 'I had a similar idea with an empty crib but didn''t have one.  This is really good. I like how Raggedy Ann is slightly more saturated with the sepia/yellow tones.  Good perspective and story.', '2009-04-20 09:36:22.000000', NULL, 1),
