(5445017, 783242, 15711, '<td valign="top">YIKES.  His expression is perfect.  I''m sure he loved the dirt in the mouth too. LOL</td>', 'YIKES.  His expression is perfect.  I''m sure he loved the dirt in the mouth too. LOL', '2009-04-20 09:37:23.000000', NULL, 1),
