(5445023, 783869, 15711, '<td valign="top">Weird. I love the Lucis style editing.  Not sure it''ll go over well with everyone else. At first I thought it was a heart. LOL</td>', 'Weird. I love the Lucis style editing.  Not sure it''ll go over well with everyone else. At first I thought it was a heart. LOL', '2009-04-20 09:39:31.000000', NULL, 1),
