(5445045, 783965, 58457, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but even though the horse is crazy looking, he is much more funny than scary.  I wish the focus were on his teeth and snout, but I do like the wide angle.</td>', 'Sorry, but even though the horse is crazy looking, he is much more funny than scary.  I wish the focus were on his teeth and snout, but I do like the wide angle.', '2009-04-20 09:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445047, 783909, 58457, '<td valign="top">I think angle of shot, lighting, and contrast could be worked on to add more drama and terror to your scene.</td>', 'I think angle of shot, lighting, and contrast could be worked on to add more drama and terror to your scene.', '2009-04-20 09:56:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445050, 783942, 54645, '<td valign="top">This cracks me up. I can see this keeping a kid up at night!</td>', 'This cracks me up. I can see this keeping a kid up at night!', '2009-04-20 09:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445051, 783930, 58457, '<td valign="top">this shot is right there as far as the idea goes, but the execution leaves a bit to be desired.  I don''t know if the eyes are too bright, or that its because they are out of focus, but I find them distracting--which is a problem since they are the point!  Its a trick lighting situation because I''d like more light on the feet, but obviously you don''t want light going under the bed...  hmmm...</td>', 'this shot is right there as far as the idea goes, but the execution leaves a bit to be desired.  I don''t know if the eyes are too bright, or that its because they are out of focus, but I find them distracting--which is a problem since they are the point!  Its a trick lighting situation because I''d like more light on the feet, but obviously you don''t want light going under the bed...  hmmm...', '2009-04-20 09:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445052, 783814, 54645, '<td valign="top">...with a smile on his face?!</td>', '...with a smile on his face?!', '2009-04-20 10:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5445053, 783932, 58457, '<td valign="top">very spooky.  my only complaints would be maybe a bit more contrast (but maybe not), and I would like to see a dressier shirt on the guy.</td>', 'very spooky.  my only complaints would be maybe a bit more contrast (but maybe not), and I would like to see a dressier shirt on the guy.', '2009-04-20 10:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
