(5447344, 783135, 19831, '<td valign="top">Wowsers!! I jumped out of my skin when this opened up. A very freaky, frightening pic, even before I saw the title. Very well depicted. That actually is what I consider an extremely horrifying way to go. Ever since I saw the movie ''The Omen'' as a child. Man, you really struck a nerve with me. But that is (IMO) what photography as art is about, invoking a strong reaction in the viewer, whether positive, or negative. So well done, and a 10 from me. Now excuse me while I go try to ''un-freak out''. :-)</td>', 'Wowsers!! I jumped out of my skin when this opened up. A very freaky, frightening pic, even before I saw the title. Very well depicted. That actually is what I consider an extremely horrifying way to go. Ever since I saw the movie ''The Omen'' as a child. Man, you really struck a nerve with me. But that is (IMO) what photography as art is about, invoking a strong reaction in the viewer, whether positive, or negative. So well done, and a 10 from me. Now excuse me while I go try to ''un-freak out''. :-)', '2009-04-21 18:16:28.000000', NULL, 1),
