(5447595, 783843, 72103, '<td valign="top">What a brilliant subject......!  However fo rteh photo has been over-processed.. I know, I know, people will say it''s dream like, but just a tad less, more contrast, more sat and some smoothing via noise reduction ( maybe even a blurriness round the oter edges ) and whoa.........!  Good find!</td>', 'What a brilliant subject......!  However fo rteh photo has been over-processed.. I know, I know, people will say it''s dream like, but just a tad less, more contrast, more sat and some smoothing via noise reduction ( maybe even a blurriness round the oter edges ) and whoa.........!  Good find!', '2009-04-21 23:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
