(5448561, 783470, 88136, '<td valign="top">well, im really not sure what i think of this. every time i come to look at it i try and leave a comment but am not sure what to say. it seems like a mobster type guy, but the knives dont seem to fit. maybe those mini machine guns they used to use in the 20s would have worked better.  i dont know, it seems very well done, the lighting and setup, but i still feel that something is off. ill probably come back with more commenting later</td>', 'well, im really not sure what i think of this. every time i come to look at it i try and leave a comment but am not sure what to say. it seems like a mobster type guy, but the knives dont seem to fit. maybe those mini machine guns they used to use in the 20s would have worked better.  i dont know, it seems very well done, the lighting and setup, but i still feel that something is off. ill probably come back with more commenting later', '2009-04-22 13:28:37.000000', NULL, 1),
