(5448578, 782935, 88136, '<td valign="top">not sure i like the angle. it doesnt feel as nightmarish looking down on the fear, id prefer a more level camera angle(but thats just me).  lighting seems a bit make-shift too, but if thats what you have its what you have(i was shooting with reading lights for like two years).  dof could either be much more shallow to only incorporate the head or eyes, or way bigger to incorporate the whole body.</td>', 'not sure i like the angle. it doesnt feel as nightmarish looking down on the fear, id prefer a more level camera angle(but thats just me).  lighting seems a bit make-shift too, but if thats what you have its what you have(i was shooting with reading lights for like two years).  dof could either be much more shallow to only incorporate the head or eyes, or way bigger to incorporate the whole body.', '2009-04-22 13:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
