(5453758, 782858, 24454, '<td valign="top">I thought this flawless macro might be yours.   Any time there is a macro that is better than anything I''ve ever seen, I think it has to be yours :)   Congratulations again!   Doesn''t get much more nightmarish than this, does it.  But a dream come true in the end.   Yayyyy!  :)</td>', 'I thought this flawless macro might be yours.   Any time there is a macro that is better than anything I''ve ever seen, I think it has to be yours :)   Congratulations again!   Doesn''t get much more nightmarish than this, does it.  But a dream come true in the end.   Yayyyy!  :)', '2009-04-27 10:36:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(5453762, 782971, 61961, '<td valign="top">One of my challenge favorites, except for the frame.  I''m glad she is holding a doll (rather than a knife or something), though I think an older doll might have worked better.  Still, interesting accident how the ''V'' her fingers make mirror the ''V'' of the doll''s eyebrows!  Btw, I thought this was one of the "too" children (<img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=53147" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">timfythetoo</a> or <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=55838" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">aimeethetoo</a>).<br/></td>', 'One of my challenge favorites, except for the frame.  I''m glad she is holding a doll (rather than a knife or something), though I think an older doll might have worked better.  Still, interesting accident how the ''V'' her fingers make mirror the ''V'' of the doll''s eyebrows!  Btw, I thought this was one of the "too" children ( timfythetoo or  aimeethetoo).', '2009-04-27 10:37:03.000000', NULL, 0),
