(5454354, 783863, 24454, '<td valign="top">Wow!  You did a FANTASTIC job making this clown look haunting and scary.  I didn''t even realize it was such a no-no to emulate a past ribbon winner.  I don''t think it should be a no-no.   Everyone has their own interpetation and way of making a shot their own.  I''m glad no one else seemed to mind either :)  Congratulations!  This is definitely award-worthy!</td>', 'Wow!  You did a FANTASTIC job making this clown look haunting and scary.  I didn''t even realize it was such a no-no to emulate a past ribbon winner.  I don''t think it should be a no-no.   Everyone has their own interpetation and way of making a shot their own.  I''m glad no one else seemed to mind either :)  Congratulations!  This is definitely award-worthy!', '2009-04-27 18:16:14.000000', NULL, 0),
