(5454967, 783933, 28322, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by RulerZigzag:</b></div><hr/><i> Under-rated In my mind, but understandable why it didn''t ribbon, DPC winners need to have that perfect lighting all the time. I was one of your 9''s, thought it was excellent. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks Anton, can''t deny I am disappointed with the result, it started with 7.3 and kept going down. One of the photographers I respect said, if you want to make something interesting, don''t light it all. This is what was in my mind, beside .. I didn''t think nightmares usually very clear and well lit :) <br/>Thanks for your kind comment Anton, appreciated.<br/></td>', 'Originally posted by RulerZigzag: Under-rated In my mind, but understandable why it didn''t ribbon, DPC winners need to have that perfect lighting all the time. I was one of your 9''s, thought it was excellent.   Thanks Anton, can''t deny I am disappointed with the result, it started with 7.3 and kept going down. One of the photographers I respect said, if you want to make something interesting, don''t light it all. This is what was in my mind, beside .. I didn''t think nightmares usually very clear and well lit :) Thanks for your kind comment Anton, appreciated.', '2009-04-28 00:07:11.000000', NULL, 0),
