(5455218, 783951, 41337, '<td valign="top">"Hue/sat and photo filter to make the sea blue." WTF??? Ok this ruined it for me. Too lazy to die the freak''n paper? Have you even looked at your camera''s manual? You do know there''s a white balance button, right? Perhaps if you put in some effort you would have scored at least a 5.0.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-04-28 03:58:31.</i></td>', '"Hue/sat and photo filter to make the sea blue." WTF??? Ok this ruined it for me. Too lazy to die the freak''n paper? Have you even looked at your camera''s manual? You do know there''s a white balance button, right? Perhaps if you put in some effort you would have scored at least a 5.0.', '2009-04-28 04:57:51.000000', '2009-04-28 04:58:31.000000', 0),
(5455346, 782858, 52115, '<td valign="top">I gueass all people who eat meat or kill insects and rodents are part of this symbolic metaphor. Think of your poor victims. Eat or be eaten.<br/> <br/>Reminds me of the old horror movie "Fly" and "Fly-II". Extreme sharpness and the red, a symbol of blood, really draw you to this nighmare themed photo. Scary, yet delicious for a fly.</td>', 'I gueass all people who eat meat or kill insects and rodents are part of this symbolic metaphor. Think of your poor victims. Eat or be eaten. Reminds me of the old horror movie "Fly" and "Fly-II". Extreme sharpness and the red, a symbol of blood, really draw you to this nighmare themed photo. Scary, yet delicious for a fly.', '2009-04-28 09:29:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(5455354, 783863, 52115, '<td valign="top">Truthfully I just saw the movie the first time about a month ago.<br/>Also the first time I went right to the director''s cut. I guess clowns can be scary, like this one is. They have never scared me, I laugh too much to take them seriously.<br/> <br/>Imitation is flattery, it''s not a crime at all. Some suggested I do a retake of my original nightmare challenge photo. It''s done here all the time, there can be hundreds of variations.<br/> <br/>The one in the movie IT also had fangs and sharp teeth. Good lighting and makeup. The eyes really lure meaning to this photo. I guess between the two of us, dpc has gotten its'' "two-cents-worth" of "Penny-wisdom".</td>', 'Truthfully I just saw the movie the first time about a month ago.Also the first time I went right to the director''s cut. I guess clowns can be scary, like this one is. They have never scared me, I laugh too much to take them seriously. Imitation is flattery, it''s not a crime at all. Some suggested I do a retake of my original nightmare challenge photo. It''s done here all the time, there can be hundreds of variations. The one in the movie IT also had fangs and sharp teeth. Good lighting and makeup. The eyes really lure meaning to this photo. I guess between the two of us, dpc has gotten its'' "two-cents-worth" of "Penny-wisdom".', '2009-04-28 09:44:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(5455356, 783882, 52115, '<td valign="top">This is also like out of a Stephen King movie. Great cropping and duotone style. Nice fingernails :-)<br/>See there can be some happy outcomes, even from nightmares.<br/>Such as your first virtual ribbon, congratulations!</td>', 'This is also like out of a Stephen King movie. Great cropping and duotone style. Nice fingernails :-)See there can be some happy outcomes, even from nightmares.Such as your first virtual ribbon, congratulations!', '2009-04-28 09:50:23.000000', NULL, 0),
