(5456451, 782411, 30364, '<td valign="top">Posthumous ribbon?  Oh Karma, I am most terribly sorry.  I''d like to be able to tell you it will work out for the best, but alas, I''m afraid this is   almost invariably fatal.  May I suggest that you say your goodbyes to any remaining ''straight'' photography friends you may have now, before the symptoms become too advanced?  It''s normally a very rapid spiral into the abyss from this point.  And once again, please accept my deepest, deepest sympathies.</td>', 'Posthumous ribbon?  Oh Karma, I am most terribly sorry.  I''d like to be able to tell you it will work out for the best, but alas, I''m afraid this is   almost invariably fatal.  May I suggest that you say your goodbyes to any remaining ''straight'' photography friends you may have now, before the symptoms become too advanced?  It''s normally a very rapid spiral into the abyss from this point.  And once again, please accept my deepest, deepest sympathies.', '2009-04-29 01:40:49.000000', NULL, 0),
