(5461193, 782043, 92512, '<td valign="top">Critique comments from the club<br/> <br/>They way the building goes full page top to bottom, adds to the dramatic larger than life effect. <br/>Image in lower right 1/3rd looks like a body laying there also add to eerieness.<br/>Black &amp; white helps avoid any color distractions and keeps one focused mainly on building and the luring effect, boosting one need to come inside to take a look.<br/>very well done desired a higher score IMO.</td>', 'Critique comments from the club They way the building goes full page top to bottom, adds to the dramatic larger than life effect. Image in lower right 1/3rd looks like a body laying there also add to eerieness.Black & white helps avoid any color distractions and keeps one focused mainly on building and the luring effect, boosting one need to come inside to take a look.very well done desired a higher score IMO.', '2009-05-01 13:00:18.000000', NULL, 0),
